{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04637","headline":"晦日诏宴永穆公主亭子赋得流字 · 张说","name":"晦日诏宴永穆公主亭子赋得流字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"堂邑山林美，朝恩晦日游。\n园亭含淑气，竹树遶春流。\n舞席千花妓，歌船五彩楼。\n羣欢与王泽，岁岁满皇州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04637.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04637","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}